        "notes": "\ud83e\udeb6 **Round 7** after you finished your build with the items already in Round 6, you can choose between two powers.\nI would recommend to pick [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) for more heal and dmg boost while ult and [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) when you want to give your team mates some more power.\nOnly pick [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) when you're sure your team mates can hit their shots, otherwise stay safe with [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb).",
